# ========================================
# QUERY PARAMETERS REFERENCE
# ========================================

### Pagination Parameters
# page: Page number (default: 1)
# limit: Items per page (default: 10, max: 100)
# 
# Example: ?page=2&limit=20

### Search and Filter Parameters
# search: Search in form names (case-insensitive)
# creatorId: Filter by creator ID
# isGlobal: Filter by global status (true/false)
# sortBy: Sort field (createdAt, updatedAt, formName, creatorId)
# sortOrder: Sort order (asc, desc)
#
# Example: ?search=event&creatorId=1&isGlobal=false&sortBy=createdAt&sortOrder=desc

### Community Response Logic
# - Forms mapped to communities: Users can respond once per community
# - Forms not mapped to communities: Users can respond only once globally
# - communityId parameter is optional (defaults to 1)

